cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite them using the metadata below, and credit OpenStreetMap as described in the README."
title: "osm-benchmarks-static: A static Wikibase of OpenStreetMap benchmarks with version history, anchored in CIDOC CRM"
abstract: >-
  A static, read-only Wikibase on GitHub Pages for OpenStreetMap benchmarks
  (survey points with a Wikimedia Commons image) in Ireland, Northern Ireland and
  Scotland. Each OSM element is one item, its version history is kept as
  statements, its geometry as WKT, and every item is anchored on a CIDOC CRM class.
  Built with wikibase-static.
type: software
authors:
